cy.graphtyDataset() loads sample datasets from the @graphty/graph-samples package (or, for the large
ones, from https://graphty.app/data/graph-samples/v1/). This package contains none of that data,
and the datasets are not under its MIT License: each has its own source, citation and license, as
far as it is known, listed in the NOTICE file of @graphty/graph-samples
(https://github.com/graphty-org/graphty-monorepo/blob/master/graph-samples/NOTICE) and in that
package's DATASETS metadata. Several are licensed only "for scientific use" or have no clear
license; check a dataset's entry before redistributing it.
